{
  "title": "Kooky Herbal Croatian Lemon Stew",
  "description": "A hearty and comforting Croatian stew featuring lemons and herbs, perfect for a sick day. This dairy-free friendly dish is sure to soothe and satisfy.",
  "cuisine": "Croatian",
  "diet": [
    "dairy-free",
